title UC.27 - Threat Mitigation & Workstation Remote Containment

|AI Copilot / IT Administrator|
start
if (Select Threat Mitigation Flow?) then (Flow 1: Read-Only Cypher Guard [FR61])
  :User submits question to Hybrid AI Copilot;
  :Text-to-Cypher generates candidate Cypher statement;
  |GraphMind Security Guard & Backend|
  :Pass query to CypherGuard.validate_read_only_cypher();
  :AST Tokenizer inspects clauses for forbidden keywords\n(CREATE, MERGE, DELETE, DETACH, SET, REMOVE, DROP, CALL dbms);
  if (Contains forbidden mutation keyword?) then (Yes [E1: Unsafe])
    :Throw UnsafeCypherQueryException & block query execution;
    :Write CRITICAL event BLOCKED_CYPHER_MUTATION to audit_logs;
    :Fallback to safe Qdrant Vector RAG retrieval;
    |AI Copilot / IT Administrator|
    :Display read-only security refusal notice & safe vector answer;
    stop
  else (No [Safe Read-Only])
    |Neo4j Driver / AEGIS Local Agent|
    :Execute read-only MATCH ... RETURN query on Neo4j;
    |AI Copilot / IT Administrator|
    :Return Knowledge Graph results & citations to user;
    stop
  endif
else (Flow 2: AEGIS Emergency Kill Switch [FR62])
  |AI Copilot / IT Administrator|
  :IT Admin detects anomalous workstation in Monitoring View;
  :Click Emergency Kill Switch & enter admin password;
  |GraphMind Security Guard & Backend|
  :Verify admin password & dispatch high-priority\nEMERGENCY_KILL command over secure WSS channel;
  |Neo4j Driver / AEGIS Local Agent|
  if (Workstation agent online & ACKs <= 3s?) then (Yes [Main Flow])
    :AEGIS Agent closes file watcher streams, stops worker\nthreads & terminates process within <= 3 seconds;
    |GraphMind Security Guard & Backend|
    :Update workstation status = TERMINATED / CONTAINED;
  else (No [E2: Workstation Offline])
    |GraphMind Security Guard & Backend|
    :Set status = UNREACHABLE_PENDING_KILL & queue\nkill command for immediate execution on reconnect;
  endif
  :Write CRITICAL event WORKSTATION_KILL_SWITCH to audit_logs;
  |AI Copilot / IT Administrator|
  :Display containment confirmation on Admin Dashboard;
  stop
endif
@enduml